{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For He hates</b> — HaShem hates that a man send away his pure wife, and <b>one who covers</b> [is read as] HaShem sees his violence that is in secret."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "Reading השם יראה (HaShem sees) for what may be a corrupt or abbreviated form; alternatively could be rendered 'HaShem [hates] the covering of violence.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:15.066389480Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}